-2.  **Sample SDF:** Evaluate $\phi$ on a regular grid of resolution $N$ [S2, unofficial]. For each grid index $(x,y,z)$, compute normalized coordinates $\mathbf{x}_i = (x/(N-1))*2 - 1$, $\mathbf{y}_i = (y/(N-1))*2 - 1$, $\mathbf{z}_i = (z/(N-1))*2 - 1$, evaluate the SDF, and store $(\mathbf{x}_i, \mathbf{y}_i, \mathbf{z}_i, \phi_i)$ [S2, unofficial].
-3.  **Construct Initial Triangulation:**
